<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore CPI rises 1.6 pct in February yr-on-yr.</title>
<headline>Singapore CPI rises 1.6 pct in February yr-on-yr.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's consumer price index (CPI) of inflation was up 1.6 percent in February from the same month last year and 0.5 percent up over January, the Department of Statistics said on Sunday.  </p>
<p>A Reuters poll of 16 economists last week forecast an average rise of 1.8 percent in the CPI.</p>
<p>In January, the CPI rose 1.9 percent from a year earlier and 0.2 percent over December.</p>
